                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It is a broken remake piece of **** of a 5? year old game.\n\nContrary to the gameplay video your timer counts down from a set number and when it reaches 0 you lose, good luck finishing a level where you have 2 minutes and the (old) youtube walkthrough takes 3:55.\n\nMaybe it is a difficult setting but that doesent matter since there are no options (that work)\n\nThere is a way to finish each level thou... you can still move the objects around if you pause the game... but that is not a \"feature\" i praise.\n\nrequest refund immediately",
